WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.960
As long as justice exists in this world,

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.380
(Narrate by Hiroaki Murakami)
evil would still remain.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.750
Behind the war between justice and evil,

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.330
there is a group of unknown warriors.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.670
Why does the business trip come so suddenly?

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.540
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
Is it a mission in a distant place?

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.880
(Touka Kuroistu, Assistant)
Could it be...

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.120
Here comes Jeanscar.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.040
The avatar of brilliant maple.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.080
Maple Kaiser, the Aki Warrior.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.040
The scorching sun in the afternoon.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.960
Gogo Red.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.750
Am I being sent to the frontline
of local heroes?

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.210
How could I make a mistake
that led to a sudden demotion?

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:46.960
I...

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.290
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.120
(The Absolute-zero Staff Officer, Megistus)

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.330
Sorry to make you come out this early morning,
Kuroitsu.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.880
Good morning, Sir Megistus.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:00.750
Do want red or black?

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.540
Red or black?

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.330
Is it a time bomb?

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.920
Pick one you like.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.500
A railway bento?

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.330
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:35.120
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:39.290
♫Live within the current power♫

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.420
♫Special force♫

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:48.580
(Miss Kuroitsu from the Monster Development Department)
♫Special force♫

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.000
♫Everyone possesses this power (Power)♫

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.710
♫Being locked up without realising it♫

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.080
♫You are the courageous flower (Flower)♫

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.830
♫Fighting against with nonsense today♫

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.000
♫Warfare against the sleepiness
in the morning♫

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.710
♫Psychological warfare begins at forenoon,
bringing the project to the meeting♫

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:10.460
♫Don't lose. You'll be fine♫

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:12.380
♫It's gonna be ok!!♫

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.960
♫The hardworking one deserves respect♫

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.460
♫You'll be rewarded one day♫

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:20.380
♫Wake up and believe in this power. Do it again♫

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:23.540
♫Everyone is special. Only one, Let's go!!♫

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.960
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.420
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:34.210
♫Persistence empowers you.
The important special force♫

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.710
♫Keep striving to march forward today
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.420
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:43.040
♫Keep it up. Stronger♫

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:46.920
♫With your beautiful special force♫

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.670
(Episode 2: Falling Asleep Upon Listening
to the Howling of Evil Spirits in the Dark Pot,)

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.040
(The Legendary Emissary of Hell Awakes
On This Land Alongside With Fear)

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.710
Mr. Kaijo.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.580
Yes.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.540
Mr. Sakurai.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.540
Yes.

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.040
Mr. Den.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.920
Yes.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.790
Miss Mizuki.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.040
Where's Miss Mizuki?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.330
Coming.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.080
I'm Mizuki.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:21.120
I'm Matsuyama. Nice to meet you.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.330
I'm Koren Mizuki. Sorry, I'm late.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.620
I forgot to bring gloves and a cutter,
so I turned back halfway.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.460
Take it. The wage for today.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.540
Is this the advance payment?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.670
So much?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.960
And this. The insurance and affidavit.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.500
Write your name and sign inside the box.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.380
An affidavit?

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:46.210
Don't tell me it's a dangerous task?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.290
Highway?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.080
Miss Matsuyama,
may I know where is the workplace?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:00.420
A bit far. In Fukuoka, I think.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.670
Fukuoka?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.000
I seem to have got the meeting point wrong.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.620
It's a different employee shuttle.

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.880
She's right. The name is Mizumoto
instead of Mizuki.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:15.000
Anyway, it's fine.
As long as I've got the number.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.170
No, the dangerous work...

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.670
Didn't you receive the money?

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.880
I'm trapped!

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.880
How could it be a time bomb?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.580
Agastia strictly forbids terrorist attacks
on ordinary people.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.580
You should know this.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:40.880
You're right though.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.960
It's because I'm clueless about this trip.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.710
We're going to observe the monster
of the opposing organisation.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:49.540
It seems Professor didn't tell you this.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.380
Yes.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:55.380
Because after his last word...

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.080
Miss Kuroitsu.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:00.460
I can't stand it anymore.
I'd like to ask you a favour.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.830
Professor.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:06.120
Take the confirmed Shinkansen train
tomorrow morning.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:09.330
Professor, what's wrong with you? Professor.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.750
I'm too dumb.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.580
I'm so silly to be fooled.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.250
I ate the mackerel that's almost expired.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.880
Then...

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:25.420
He just fell asleep after the last word.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.580
It's something that can't be avoided though.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:32.330
But, we can't get it clear without the presence
of Development Department this time.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.500
I'm counting on you, Kuroitsu.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.540
Sure, I'll handle it.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.670
(Red Bento)
Besides, it's my first business trip.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.540
I'm kind of looking forward to it.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.460
Though we're not going on a travel trip,

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:48.920
I can understand you as you deem it
as if it's a travel.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.170
Yes.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.920
Red is a good choice.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.460
Bon appetit.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.460
Yummy.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.580
Sir Megistus, you're...

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:08.670
Of course, I'm working.
Even the travel time can be used effectively.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.790
Should I do something?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:22.120
It's fine. Just rest.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:25.540
I'm resting at the same time too.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:32.580
What Sir Megistus said isn't to comfort
his subordinates, it's true instead.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.710
The terrible brain of
Absolute-Zero Staff Officer

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:38.460
has divided attention.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:47.670
He can think from the subjective, objective,
and other angles according to the situation

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:51.460
and also supplement sleep for the unused parts.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.670
It's time.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:56.420
Is it a business phone call?

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:59.710
No. My stamina has recovered.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.580
(Rank Number One)
Sir Megistus plays games too?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:08.290
This game seems time-consuming.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:15.120
It's a game app under the surface enterprise
of our organisation.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.540
As the person-in-charge,

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.710
I should play the game and discover the bugs.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.380
Also, I should stand in the shoe
of the game developer

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:28.380
to decide on whether playing immersively
or relaxingly is better.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:32.920
So I play multiple games
with my different consciousnesses.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:35.790
This is divided attention.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.420
Sir Megistus.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:41.920
Do you play all games develop by the enterprise?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.040
Of course.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.920
I'd also check on the products manufactured
as well.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.460
I should be a responsible person in charge.

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.120
Amongst the affiliated enterprises,

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:57.000
there are also companies that manufacture
cosmetic and household goods.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:01.830
No way. I'd better stop here.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.380
(No Entry)

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:09.830
I'm Kuroitsu from Monster Development Department
of Secret Society Agastia.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.620
Thank you for your introduction.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.540
I'm the president of Secret Society Evil.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.580
Danger Kamen.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.330
I'm sorry. You specially make a visit here,
yet I look messy.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:25.330
It's fine. I've watched the battle just now.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.580
It's really tough to fight the six heroes.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.120
It's really helpful that you did
a precise analysis, Kuroitsu.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:37.790
It's great to have a specialist.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.380
I'd take it as the reference
for the world-conquering plan.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:43.540
I was skeptical
whether I could do Professor's work.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.500
Fortunately, everything went well.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.960
It reminds me of one thing
as you mentioned Professor.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.380
What's it?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:55.080
I have one more important problem.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:04.540
Originally, I was going to stay
with Professor in one room.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.960
So, I order a double room.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:10.580
Professor and Sir Megistus stay in one room?

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.670
Please, Sir Megistus.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:19.120
You shower first.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:24.290
No, I'd like a bath. You first.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.250
Yes...

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.420
It'd be tiring to be concerned for him.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:33.960
I'm sorry to tell you
that there's no empty room.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:39.250
Sharing a room with a female colleague
is against social morality.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.750
I'll look for an available room in other hotels.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:46.710
It's Development Department's fault
as Professor couldn't come.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:48.790
No, please don't do that.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.210
I'll deal with the staff here.

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:54.170
You may check-in and rest first.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.330
But...

00:09:56.330 --> 00:10:01.750
Never let me be a shameful supervisor
who rests first.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:06.080
You know Agastia is a great evil organisation,
don't you?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.540
It's such an easy task to order a hotel room
for me.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:14.460
I got it. I'll rest now.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.500
Well, I'm going to introduce...

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.000
Though he's a composed man,

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.830
I could still feel his sense of dominance.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.380
It's me.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:31.170
Have you got a room, Sir Megistus?

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.750
Don't worry.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:36.460
They've prepared me the best room.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.000
Telling this to someone
who's supposed to share the room is kind of...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.250
Are you curious?

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:45.830
No. See you tomorrow and sorry to trouble you.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.080
Have a good rest.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.920
Take the medicine and have a good night.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:02.710
It's more relaxing here.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:04.710
Absolute-Zero Staff Officer

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:07.540
was typing on the keyboard very softly that day

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.290
as he didn't wish to disturb others.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:14.380
He went to sleep without worries
after working till late at night.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:26.580
Mummy, Tokyo is a scary place.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.460
(Cannon Thunderbird,
Long-range Sniper Special Monster)

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:32.580
(Monster Development Department)

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:36.040
It's for you. The card key
of Monster Development Department.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.500
I've set it for your personal use.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.580
Besides, though you can assess the room freely,

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:45.290
you're not allowed to touch anything.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.830
Ask me or Miss Kuroitsu

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.330
if there's anything you don't understand.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:53.580
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
Do you feel any discomfort afterward,

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.330
(Wolf Bete, New Assistant)
Any problem with the urinary system?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.750
Who knows?

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:02.580
Besides, I have totally no idea about
what's a normal condition should be.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.170
You're right. After all, you're a guy.

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:05.750
Originally...

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.880
Never said that again.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:11.170
It's the same case for going to the washroom.
Which one should I go to?

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:13.000
Choose according to your preference,
isn't it good?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.290
Because it's correct to go either side
in your condition.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.330
But to me, it's terribly wrong.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.500
I must turn back into a guy.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.710
Speaking of which, what was going on?

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:28.330
I was created to fight Kenshin Blade, wasn't I?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.830
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
Because we have always been understaffed.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:35.040
(Professor Hajime Sadamaki)
Though we've applied to Personnel Department,

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.250
however, no one joins in.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:42.040
Therefore, we made you join our department.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.670
Welcome to Monster Development Department.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.790
I can't accept this.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.380
Why are you so happy?

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.880
Because it's my first time having a junior
in work.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:11.290
I'll guide you kindly

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:15.250
and this thing, that thing, and this thing.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:17.500
This senior is scary.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.500
Are you dissatisfied, Wolf?

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.040
Because my brain isn't good,

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.040
I'm not suitable for developing work.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.040
True. Wolf's mental age

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.960
is set at the level of a high schoolboy.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.120
Really?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.290
However, we need diversity in the proposal.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.250
Wolf's suggestion might work too.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.750
Moreover, you'll be moved

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.880
if the monster development you're involved in
is accomplished.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:48.040
So, I'm very happy to work together with Wolf.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:53.080
I'm sorry to interrupt you.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:57.330
It's time to brief you about the new project.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.080
The new monster project you mentioned
last time?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.330
That's right.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.880
A monster based on a giant bird monster
from legend.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:08.670
Equipped with large-caliber
electromagnetic cannons on both shoulders

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.960
it can also be charged from thunder

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.380
and launch attacks from the air.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:16.620
Its name is Cannon Thunderbird.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.120
Awesome!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.540
You have a good eye for quality, Wolf.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.040
Large caliber is always the best.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.080
Machinery is indeed a man's romance.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:30.710
It's the huge and robust ultimate monster
loaded with powerful weapons.

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.500
If so, it'd definitely defeat Kenshin Blade.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.000
Hold on, Professor.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.170
What's the matter, Miss Kuroitsu?

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.250
It's stated above that

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:46.500
all procedures from developing to manufacturing
must be handed over to different departments.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.120
That's the trouble.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.330
Because it's the first time developing a cyborg.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:55.580
So, they can't give free rein to our department,
which's mainly based on biology.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.830
I have a sinking feeling.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:03.000
(Strategy Promotion Department of Agastia)
I'm Nikaido from Strategy Promotion Department.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.460
(Takaomi Nikaido, Person-in-charge)
I'm the project leader

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:09.040
who's going to lead and promote this case.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:13.330
Erm...This is a monster project.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.620
Monster Development Department
should take the lead instead.

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:20.580
No, it's a case that requires coordination with
every department.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:24.710
It can't be led by Development Department
which's inexperienced in supervising.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.250
But...

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.420
Besides,

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:31.330
I couldn't stand the unplanned schedule
and the way of using budget

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.210
of Monster Development Department.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.710
What's this?
Why this useless design again?

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:46.960
Adding many unnecessary weapons leads to
weight gains, that's why a big body is needed.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.620
Don't you know it wastes
a lot of developing time and budget?

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:54.500
One electromagnetic cannon is enough.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:00.460
Therefore, the design is revised.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.330
(Design Department of Agastia)
No.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.330
(Shinya Kazematsuri, Head of Department)
The appearance doesn't look nice.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.380
I...

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:08.500
This is a monster for battling.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.000
The appearance...

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:14.000
No way. Appearance prevails everything.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:18.460
No wonder I've been thinking
that Development Department lacks something.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.920
Change this into this and this.
And change that part into this.

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:26.000
Oh my, remove the annoying antenna.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.250
You too, Kuroitsu.
I'll design an outfit for you next time.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.750
Perhaps you'll become more popular.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.750
No, thanks.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.710
Therefore, the design is revised.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:42.330
(Control Department of Agastia)
What's the transformation mechanism about?

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:45.290
(Mei Sasaki, Head of Department)
It's dangerous if one accidentally gets caught.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:49.000
No, monster should be dangerous...

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.920
It's the same case for high voltage terminals.
It might cause electric shock too.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.830
A small mistake might lead to a major accident.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:59.880
Therefore, the design is revised.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.790
The electromagnetic cannon is pretty good.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.120
But, you haven't considered
the manufacturing, right?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.540
(Direct Factory of Agastia)
Who can make this kind of stuff?

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.380
(Tatsutoku Koga, Factory Director)
Could you design something more practical?

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:14.330
Therefore, the design is revised.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.210
This is cool.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:25.380
(Leader of Secret Society Agastia)
But, if the wings can be more fluffy...

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:26.540
(Akashic)
It looks better.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.830
Therefore, the design is...

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.790
The first design.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.120
The understanding of Project Leader.

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:39.040
The idea of Designer.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.670
Security management of System Control.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.830
The request of Factory Director.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.830
The comment of Leader.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:55.170
What's this? It's totally different
from the original one.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.750
Because many departments involved this time.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.500
Generally, it wouldn't change to such an extent.

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:07.120
By the way, we have to meet the factory director
to discuss the amendment.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.330
Again?

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:17.460
Thunder Charging System...

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:23.210
That girl is really hardworking.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.210
It's rare to have such people now.

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:28.000
Factory Director...

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.040
You're the monster of our company, aren't you?

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.040
How's it? How's your body feel?

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.420
I can't really tell.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.750
Because it didn't go as planned.

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.670
That couldn't be avoided though.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:42.380
After all, it's rare for a plan
to go through smoothly like that.

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:44.960
Seriously?

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:46.080
Yes.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:49.290
Everyone might interject their ideas anyway.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.920
But, that girl wouldn't follow
superiors' orders directly.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.830
In the tight budget and schedule,

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.250
she was running around
at the cost of her sleep

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:02.250
to produce a better monster.

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:04.620
Every time she came here for amendments

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.620
was to ask us to fulfill unreasonable requests.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.790
Her enthusiasm is like treating the monster
as important as her family.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.750
Speaking of which,
you're so cute.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:19.170
Why is she dissatisfied?

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.670
Annoying. Mind your own business.

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:23.920
I'm sorry.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:27.120
Nowadays, it'd be deemed as
sexual harassment if one speaks like this.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:28.920
Oh my.

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:36.500
Of course, I knew this body is pretty nice.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:40.290
By the way, you didn't wear bra, Wolf.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:44.830
How could I wear it? I don't even have one.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.620
Let's go and get it next time.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.830
(Cannon Thunderbird)
Cannon Thunderbird is finally done.

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:01.580
(Long Range Sniper Special Monster)
You've worked hard this time.

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:05.670
It should be fine even if
we don't go to Staff Officer for approval.

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:09.330
Cannon, is there any discomfort in your body?

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.080
None. I'm good.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:14.540
I'm clear about my mission.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.040
Nice to meet you, Senior Wolf.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:20.580
Though I'm incompetent,
please treat me favourably.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:23.670
I'm on cloud nine now.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.790
Though the submission is tight,

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.750
everyone still worked their best
to accomplish it.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.790
Great job, everyone.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.210
Yes.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.790
You've worked hard.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:39.250
In the unknown place of monster development,

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:43.880
a brand new evil warrior is born here.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:49.170
There's a group of technicians who pour
their passion and soul behind the scene.

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:51.830
Only a few people are aware of

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.670
the hard work.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:55.080
Cheers.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.250
Although there's a bundle of hardship,

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:01.330
I've understood a little now, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:04.880
The interesting part of
Monster Development Department.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:09.170
Next, it's time to defeat Kenshin Blade.

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:11.080
You can do it, Cannon.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.460
Yes, I'll do it, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:22.000
♫The rain of determination falls
under the scorching sun♫

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:27.250
(Kenshin Blade)
♫Get rid of the heat♫

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:32.040
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:36.960
♫Always be with you,
I can't see the light. Yeah!♫

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:42.380
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.710
♫Always be with you♫

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:52.290
♫Such an ordinary day♫

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:56.830
♫I'm willing to give up everything for you♫

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:02.120
♫Thousands of scars♫

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:06.120
♫Tears in eyes can no longer flow♫

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:11.750
♫Even the past that I want to erase from memory♫

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:15.960
♫Has become a weapon and let's get♫

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:17.210
♫Ready♫

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:22.170
(The Local Heroes in This Episode)
♫Ignite my courage with the blade♫

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:25.880
(Jeanscar, God of Genkiryo Blade)
♫Split the path without an answer into two♫

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:27.290
(Maple Kaiser, Aki Warrior)
♫And march forward to the future♫

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:32.540
(Gogo Red, Shayo Warrior)
♫I must be stronger than before♫

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:36.120
(Dogengers & Danger Kamen)
♫Let go of the anxiety and run forward♫

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:37.500
(These Heroes Are Not Fictional but Real)
♫Let go of the anxiety and run forward♫

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:42.500
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:50.170
Razor crush!

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:58.040
Cannon!

00:22:58.040 --> 00:22:59.960
Look at what you've done.

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:03.620
It costs us a tremendous effort to create that.

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:06.620
Blade, you're a ghost, an evil,
a cold-blooded brat.

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:09.540
No, it's useless to tell me this.

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:11.120
Since you're doing it,

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:14.460
isn't it better to create a monster
that's more ordinary, bigger, stronger

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:18.080
and loaded with powerful weapons?

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:26.170
Then, the final product that customer needs.

00:23:27.330 --> 00:23:28.000
(When a Monster Who Always Dies and Reborns)
Next episode.

